menu "Noise crypto bench (#2065)"
    choice NOISE_BENCH_BACKEND
        prompt "Crypto backend"
        default NOISE_BENCH_BACKEND_PSA
        help
            The backend the NNpsk0 handshake and the per-frame AEAD run on. NONE builds the
            same app with every crypto call compiled out: the baseline image the backend's
            flash and static RAM are measured against.

        config NOISE_BENCH_BACKEND_NONE
            bool "none (baseline image)"
        config NOISE_BENCH_BACKEND_PSA
            bool "mbedTLS PSA Crypto (ships with ESP-IDF)"
    endchoice

    config NOISE_BENCH_WITH_WIFI
        bool "Bring Wi-Fi up (station init, no association)"
        default n
        help
            Initializes the Wi-Fi stack so its own crypto (wpa_supplicant over mbedTLS) is
            linked. Built with and without a backend, the difference is the backend's MARGINAL
            flash on a node that already ships Wi-Fi.
endmenu
